{"about_the_game":"Kurr Snaga is a fast-paced first person melee brawler where players act as the last Orc left from their tribe taking revenge on the evil humans. <br><br>Players will fight humans in various scenarios with different weapons, using environment hazards to their advantage, turning every human they see into a big blood pile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br><br><strong>Intense fast-paced melee combat</strong><br>Fast and responsive combat system will lead players into a action-packed battle against threatful and agile enemies. Seamless actions allows the player to chain their moves fluently and perform like a skilled orc warrior.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/3a18cab822a415499a41cf1f8b9a1dcc.poster.avif?t=1758748092\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/3a18cab822a415499a41cf1f8b9a1dcc.webm?t=1758748092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/3a18cab822a415499a41cf1f8b9a1dcc.mp4?t=1758748092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Physical based environment hazard</strong><br>The interactable environment gives players numerous options to defeat their enemy utilizing physics. Push a boulder down hill to knock down enemies in a row, kick your enemy onto spike pillars, anything you can think of.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/5a743f096ffd47548f7dbcd6ee85862d.poster.avif?t=1758748092\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/5a743f096ffd47548f7dbcd6ee85862d.webm?t=1758748092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/5a743f096ffd47548f7dbcd6ee85862d.mp4?t=1758748092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br><strong>Various game modes</strong><br><br>Different game modes are available for every single level. Go on a full rampage in Kill Quota to eliminate a number of enemies in a limited time, or try to survive against the vast swarm of enemies in the Endless mode.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1072310?t=1758748092","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758748092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758748092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758748092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Kurr Snaga is a fast-paced first person melee brawler where players act as the last Orc left from their tribe taking revenge on the evil humans. <br><br>Players will fight humans in various scenarios with different weapons, using environment hazards to their advantage, turning every human they see into a big blood pile.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br><br><strong>Intense fast-paced melee combat</strong><br>Fast and responsive combat system will lead players into a action-packed battle against threatful and agile enemies. Seamless actions allows the player to chain their moves fluently and perform like a skilled orc warrior.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072310/extras/3a18cab822a415499a41cf1f8b9a1dcc.